<section class="side-section"><h3><Settings2 size={15} />下载设置</h3><fieldset disabled={disabled} class="settings-fields"><div class="setting-card"><div class="setting-label">保存到</div><button type="button" class="path-button" aria-label="选择下载目录" on:click={onChooseDir}><span>{config.downloadDir || '选择下载目录'}</span><FolderOpen size={14} /></button></div><fieldset class="setting-card proxy-fieldset"><legend class="setting-label"><Globe2 size={13} />代理</legend><div class="segmented" role="group" aria-label="代理模式"><button type="button" class:active={config.proxyMode === 'none'} aria-pressed={config.proxyMode === 'none'} on:click={() => config.proxyMode = 'none'}>关闭</button><button type="button" class:active={config.proxyMode === 'system'} aria-pressed={config.proxyMode === 'system'} on:click={() => config.proxyMode = 'system'}>系统</button><button type="button" class:active={config.proxyMode === 'custom'} aria-pressed={config.proxyMode === 'custom'} on:click={() => config.proxyMode = 'custom'}>自定义</button></div>{#if config.proxyMode === 'custom'}<input id="proxy-url" class="proxy-input" bind:value={config.proxyUrl} aria-label="自定义代理地址" placeholder="HTTP 或 SOCKS5 代理 URL" />{/if}<p class="hint">端口由你填写，不预设固定端口。</p></fieldset><div class="setting-card"><div class="setting-label">GitHub Token（多账号 / 私有仓库）</div>{#each config.githubTokens as entry, index}<div class="token-row"><input class="token-name" bind:value={entry.label} placeholder="备注" aria-label={`Token ${index + 1} 备注`} /><input class="token-secret" type="password" autocomplete="off" spellcheck="false" bind:value={entry.token} placeholder="Personal Access Token" aria-label={`Token ${index + 1}`} />{#if entry.login}<span class="token-login" title="已识别的账号">@{entry.login}</span>{/if}<button type="button" class="token-remove" aria-label={`删除 Token ${index + 1}`} on:click={() => config.githubTokens = config.githubTokens.filter((_, i) => i !== index)}><X size={13} /></button></div>{/each}<button type="button" class="token-add" on:click={() => config.githubTokens = [...config.githubTokens, { label: '', token: '', login: '' }]}><Plus size={13} />添加 Token</button><p class="hint">Token 仅保存在本机配置文件中，不会上传到任何服务器，也不会泄露给第三方，仅在访问 GitHub API 时随请求携带。首次使用时会通过 GitHub 账号接口识别 Token 归属并缓存，之后按仓库 owner 自动选择对应账号的 Token，未匹配时使用第一个。建议使用只读权限的 Fine-grained Token。</p></div><button type="button" class="save-settings" on:click={onSave}><Check size={14} />保存设置</button></fieldset></section>
